    # DIVINE @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    DIVINE @ talk "{i}はあ…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:13
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_745474fe:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Any such decisions would have to be reviewed and approved by other council members."
    DIVINE @ talk "そのような決定は、他の評議会メンバーによる審査と承認が必要となる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:14
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_f3038604:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Things are...very stringent around here."
    DIVINE @ talk "ここは...非常に厳しいです"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:17
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_ea7fcfec:

    # DIVINE @ talk "All of the mages have strict rules and regulations on most matters, even who you marry."
    DIVINE @ talk "すべての魔術師たちは、ほとんどの事柄について、結婚相手に至るまで、厳格な規則と規制を定めている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:18
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_4e619828:

    # MC @ talk "Who you marry?"
    MC @ talk "誰と結婚する？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:19
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_c62d19f2:

    # DIVINE @ talk "A mage can prove to be a powerful political asset for anyone; any binding unions need to seek the approval of the high council before they can get married."
    DIVINE @ talk "魔術師は誰にとっても強力な政治的資産となり得るため、いかなる結婚も上層評議会の承認を得なければならない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:20
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_a761da03:

    # MC @ talk "I suppose that makes sense, though I imagine it leaves many a mage in an awkward position should they fall in love with the wrong person."
    MC @ talk "なるほど、確かにそうかもしれません。ですが、それが多くの魔術師を厄介な立場に追い込むことになれば、彼らが不適切な相手と恋に落ちた場合のことですが。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:21
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_5550ab39:

    # "Sister Divine sighed softly."
    "シスターディバインは軽くため息をついた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:22
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_0572dcf9:

    # DIVINE @ sad "{i}It does indeed...{/i}"
    DIVINE @ sad "{i}確かに…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:28
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_7806a4fd:

    # DIVINE @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    DIVINE @ talk "{i}はあ{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:29
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_29a60b44:

    # DIVINE @ talk "I suppose I could {i}attempt{/i} to pull some strings once more, even if it was just to keep the patch for her temporarily."
    DIVINE @ talk "{i}手を回す{/i}ことは、彼女のために仮の取り計らいをするだけだとしても、再び試みてもよいだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:30
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_2_7b106cd0:

    # DIVINE @ talk "But ... What can you offer me in return?"
    DIVINE @ talk "でも……見返りに何を私に提供してくれる？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:33
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_ba415944:

    # "Sister Divine's breathing became heavy as she shivered to my touch."
    "聖女ディバインは、私の触れられて震えながら、息を荒げていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:34
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_4ce3b50b:

    # DIVINE @ shock "I..."
    DIVINE @ shock "あの…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:35
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_59ecb4a2:

    # DIVINE @ embar "Alright, fine!"
    DIVINE @ embar "もういいよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:36
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_e602f508:

    # DIVINE @ lewd "You better make good on that offer."
    DIVINE @ lewd "約束は守るんだぜ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:37
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_4caa9ae7:

    # MC @ lewd "Oh, don't worry, I plan on making it {i}unforgettable{/i} for you."
    MC @ lewd "ああ、心配しないで、君に{i}忘れられない{/i}ものにしてやるからね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:38
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_8422454d:

    # "Sister Divine let out another excited, trembling hot breath as she tried to keep herself composed."
    "聖女ディバインは、またしても熱っぽく震える吐息を漏らしながら、なんとか自分を保とうとしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:39
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_37a611c2:

    # DIVINE @ lewd "I look forward to it ... Now tell Mika she has her farming patch, for now, at least."
    DIVINE @ lewd "楽しみにしているよ…さて、今のところは少なくとも、ミカに農場区画を与えたと伝えておいて。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:44
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_3b9bc389:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Hmm ... I suppose coin would certainly soften the blow of any criticisms at the next council meeting."
    DIVINE @ talk "ふむ…次回の評議会での批判も、コインがあれば幾分か和らげられるだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:45
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_3_d9d37a65:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Say, [QstLittleLies().divinePersuasionCost] should suffice..."
    DIVINE @ talk "ねぇ、[QstLittleLies().divinePersuasionCost]で十分でしょう…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:49
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_e2005c67:

    # DIVINE @ happy "Very good. Tell Mika the patch she wants is hers, at least for now."
    DIVINE @ happy "結構だ。ミカに望みのパッチは彼女の物だと言え、少なくとも今のところは。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:55
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_fddc0898:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Urgh, very well, I suppose I can make do with two thousand ... But not a coin less!"
    DIVINE @ talk "ふん、よかろう、二千枚で済ませてやる… それ以下は認めん!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:58
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_0659d7ff:

    # DIVINE @ talk "I can't go to the council without some kind of offering to ease any questions."
    DIVINE @ talk "何らかの貢ぎ物を持たなければ、評議会に出向いて取り繕う訳にはいかない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:59
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_7fefe1d1:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Return when you have the coin..."
    DIVINE @ talk "コインを手に入れたら戻ってきて…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:62
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_c3ec61e5:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Well ... There is {i}one{/i} thing that I believe could persuade me."
    DIVINE @ talk "さて…{i}一つだけ{/i}、私を説得できるかもしれないことがあります。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:63
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_fd215e94:

    # MC @ talk "Speak it?"
    MC @ talk "言ってみる？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:64
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_56ff34f3:

    # DIVINE @ talk "A great white bear, exceptionally rare and particularly aggressive, known as a {i}rhuvan.{/i}"
    DIVINE @ talk "極めて稀で特に獰猛なホッキョクグマ、{i}ルヴァン{/i}として知られる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:65
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_3f57fbb1:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Their hide is exceptionally prized and could be used as a gift to carry favor with many a lord and such."
    DIVINE @ talk "その皮は極めて貴重で、贈り物として多くの領主などの歓心を買うのに用いられる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:66
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_2e78ce9d:

    # DIVINE @ talk "Should you be able to slay one of them and bring me its hide, I could give Mika her gardening patch in return."
    DIVINE @ talk "もし、そのうちの一頭を討ち取って、その革を持ってきてくれたなら、ミカに庭の一区画を与えてやるよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:67
translate ja qst_girl_troubles_main_label_menu_4_d4880874:

    # MC @ think "Hm, I shall think on it."
    MC @ think "ええ、考えておくか。"

